# Karabiner-Elements saves karabiner.json by writing a temp file and renaming
# it over the target, which replaces any symlink with a regular file. Stowing
# it therefore breaks on the next GUI change and the repo drifts silently.
#
# It is mirrored into the repo instead: scripts/sync-karabiner.sh copies the
# live file here, and .githooks/pre-commit runs that before every commit.
karabiner\.json
